# Re-include trial logs.
#
# The repo root .gitignore has `*.log` at line 4, which comes from upstream
# scala3's build infrastructure -- editing it would put a diff in every PR. This
# nested negation is scoped to our own experiments directory instead.
#
# These logs are worth keeping: they carry the SearchReplaceNoExactMatch counts,
# the rate-limit retries and aider's injected lint prompts. Every diagnosis in
# this experiment so far came out of them, and none of it appears in the
# .result.txt summary.
!*.log
